section.statement(data-timing="35")
  h2 Everyone you meet is in their own spaceship.
  aside.notes
    ul
      li We share some words and some concepts, but no actual truth.
      li You can connect, but you'll never see what they see inside their spaceship.
      li And that's beautiful. People can surprise you. Empathy is the most valuable thing you have.

